WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Four prices. One candle.. A candle summarizes the open, high, low, and close for one time period.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The body. The body connects the opening and closing prices. It shows the net price change.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The wicks. Thin lines extend to the highest and lowest prices reached during the period.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Green and red. Green closes above the open. Red closes below the open. Neither color predicts the next candle.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Try the LIVE view. Sprout LIVE candles cover 30 seconds each. Inspect a candle and compare its four prices.

